url: "https://github.com/mjaskowski/axspa-yolo-cls"
abstract: >-
  Deep learning model for radiographic changes on lateral spinal radiographs, classifying structural
  spinal changes on lateral radiographs in patients evaluated for axial
  spondyloarthritis (axSpA). Uses YOLO11l-cls architecture (Ultralytics)
  with external validation across two Polish centers.
keywords:
  - axial spondyloarthritis
  - deep learning
  - YOLO
  - spinal radiography
  - external validation
  - convolutional neural network
